# .gitignore — defensive against accidental publication of private/hazardous evidence.
# Strategy: ignore broad classes of sensitive/large artifacts, then RE-ALLOW only the
# intentional, reviewed public artifacts. Do NOT widen the allow-rules.

# ---- Loose malware payloads (must only ever exist inside password-protected ZIPs) ----
*.exe
*.dll
*.msi
*.ps1
*.bat
*.cmd
*.vbs
*.js
*.jse
*.hta
*.scr
*.jar
*.lnk
*.bin
*.dat
*.raw
*.sys
*.elf
*.so
*.o
*.msp
*.cab

# ---- VM / disk / memory / forensic images ----
*.ova
*.ovf
*.vmdk
*.vdi
*.vhd
*.vhdx
*.qcow2
*.img
*.iso
*.sav
*.dmp
*.mem
*.core
*.raw.img
*.e01
*.aff

# ---- Packet captures (publish only sanitized, explicitly re-allowed ones) ----
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.etl
*.pml

# ---- Mailbox / browser / account / credential material ----
*.mbox
*.eml
*.pst
*.ost
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
places.sqlite*
cookies.sqlite*
formhistory.sqlite*
favicons.sqlite*
logins.json
key?.db
cert?.db
*cookies*
*session*
*token*
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
known_hosts
*.ppk
.bash_history
.zsh_history
*.xbel
recently-used*

# ---- Archives in general (re-allow only the intended malware ZIPs below) ----
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.*
*.tgz
*.zst
*.gz

# ---- Temp / scratch / OS cruft ----
*~
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
scratch/
tmp/

# =====================================================================
# RE-ALLOW: only the intentional, reviewed public artifacts.
# Keep these rules NARROW. Never re-allow a whole evidence directory.
# =====================================================================

# Intentional, password-protected malware sample archives (one artifact per ZIP):
!malware/samples/*.zip

# Instrumentation scripts are legitimate research tooling, not malware payloads:
!instrumentation/*.ps1

# NOTE: never re-allow loose VM images, malware payloads, or incident evidence.
# The prepared lab is distributed as encrypted GitHub Release assets.

# Prepared lab archive chunks are uploaded as GitHub Release assets, never committed.
iclickrickroll/*.zip.part[0-9][0-9]
iclickrickroll/*.part[0-9][0-9]
iclickrickroll/assets/

# Local maintainer path to release assets (never publish).
iclickrickroll/.release-assets-path

# Downloader output if a researcher explicitly places it inside the clone.
iclickrickroll-download/
